[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0010","text":"……哇"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0020","text":"……？\n日花，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0030","text":"啊，不好意思，有只虫子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0040","text":"诶……！\n哪、哪里……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0050","text":"现在停在那边"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0060","text":"……好、好大一只啊……！\n开窗的话，它会飞出去吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0070","text":"要是乱动的话\n它可能会扑过来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0080","text":"这、这样啊……！\n那我就不动了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0100","text":"好像飞出房间了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0110","text":"太，太好了～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0120","text":"……日花\n谢谢你呀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0130","text":"诶？\n为什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0140","text":"你不是跟我说\n不要动比较好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0150","text":"多亏了你，它什么事都没发生\n就自己飞走了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021400_01_0160","text":"啊，不、不客气……"}]
